      "status": "projectRulingPending",
      "directlyClosedByPrimaryRules": false,
      "recommended": "At actual reveal readiness, if a living participant cannot show a card, end this contest layer without a winner or rewards. Preserve paid costs, start effects and already completed top-to-hand moves; do not shuffle unshown cards. Resume its parent continuation.",
